<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets warrants on basket of Taiwan metal stocks.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on basket of Taiwan metal stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Tuesday it proposed to issue 10 million American-style U.S. dollar composite call warrants on a basket of three Taiwan metal</p>
<p>stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> Kuei Hung Industrial	   1 share</p>
<p> Tung Ho Steel		    1 share</p>
<p> Feng Hsin Iron		   1 share</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     US$3.03	 PREMIUM	 13.9 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	US$0.42117    GEARING	 7.19X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 17.SEP.97     MIN EXER LOT  1,000</p>
<p> LISTING	    LUXEMBOURG    PAYDATE	 14.JAN.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE   US$3.03	 LISTING DATE  14.JAN.97</p>
<p>CO-LEAD MANAGER  FIRST TAIWAN SECURITIES (HK) LTD.</p>
<p> NOTE		 CASH SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
